      "source_primary": "PART",
      "source_secondary": [
        "NOUN"
      ],
      "issue_type": "MORPHEME_NOT_NOUN",
      "linguistic_rationale_zh": "“读者、强者”中的“者”是附着名词化后缀；整个“强者”指人不等于“者”单独是名词。古汉语独用“者”的证据需要与现代中文目标语域区分。",
      "editorial_action": "PROPOSE_REMOVE_NOUN",
      "status": "CG_ZH_SUPPLEMENTAL_REVIEW_NOT_CERTIFIED"
    },
    {
      "term": "最后",
      "term_id": "zh_445905122e87b9907cf5",
      "runtime_index": 261,
      "source_primary": "NOUN",
      "source_secondary": [
        "ADV"
      ],
      "issue_type": "REVIEW_TAXONOMY",
      "linguistic_rationale_zh": "“最后一道题”是次序限定；“到了最后”可进入介词结构，“最后才到”担任时间状语。状语句法功能不自动证明独立ADV词汇类别；须区分时间名词/方位词与顺序副词。",
      "editorial_action": "KEEP_PENDING",
      "status": "CG_ZH_SUPPLEMENTAL_REVIEW_NOT_CERTIFIED"
    },
    {
      "term": "两个",
      "term_id": "zh_eab040a4964afffaf8dd",
      "runtime_index": 274,
      "source_primary": "NUM",
      "source_secondary": [
        "DET"
      ],
      "issue_type": "ANALYZABLE_QUANTITY_PHRASE",
      "linguistic_rationale_zh": "“两个学生”中“两”为数词、“个”为量词；整串可以作名词短语数量限定语，但不能据此推断“两个”是单一NUM或DET词。词库可保留该稳定词项供短查询匹配，分词需允许“两/个”组成分析。",
      "editorial_action": "DO_NOT_PUBLISH_AS_ATOMIC_NUM",
      "status": "CG_ZH_SUPPLEMENTAL_REVIEW_NOT_CERTIFIED"
    },
    {
      "term": "一种",
      "term_id": "zh_9523358742c72e1deb24",
      "runtime_index": 288,
      "source_primary": "NUM",
      "source_secondary": [
        "DET"
      ],
      "issue_type": "ANALYZABLE_QUANTITY_PHRASE",
      "linguistic_rationale_zh": "“一种办法”由数词“一”与量词“种”组成，整个数量结构修饰“办法”；DET是结构功能而非另一独立词性证据。检索词项可保留，切分须允许一/种。",
      "editorial_action": "DO_NOT_PUBLISH_AS_ATOMIC_NUM",
      "status": "CG_ZH_SUPPLEMENTAL_REVIEW_NOT_CERTIFIED"
    },
    {
